## Personality

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| **Personality Trait** | Eloquent flattery makes everyone he talks to feel important — right up until they're no longer useful. |
| **Ideal** | Legacy. His family's name was disgraced; he will restore it, whatever the cost, and by whatever hand. He has never decided whether a name is worth anything at all, or whether the world simply belongs to whoever is holding the sword — and he intends to find out. |
| **Bond** | Ilvaneth is family — the only one he has left. Will reclaim what was taken from his clan, and anyone who stands in the way will learn why dragons are feared. |
| **Flaw** | Pride. Cannot let an insult, however small, go unanswered. |

