### Notable Items

- **Sending Stone (1 of the pair)** — Marek Stillwright's unclaimed commission, The Maker's Undoing Room 19 (day 57), Identified day 60. Originally paired with Ilvaneth's stone while the party was split (day 60 — Ilvaneth to Ostwick, Kriv to Shestendeliath Hold). **Day 65, session 15**: now that Kriv and Ilvaneth are both at the Hold, Ilvaneth deattuned her stone and gave it to Kriv, who passed it to Roskel (now attuned to it, steward of the Hold — see `party/companions/roskel.md`) — the pair now links **Kriv and Roskel** instead, so Roskel can reach him once daily (50 words) whenever Kriv is away from the Hold. Once daily, send/receive a 50-word message to/from the paired stone. No attunement needed on his end — his 3 slots (Barrow-King's Blade, Cloak of Elvenkind, Amulet of Proof against Detection and Location) stay as they are.
- **Bag of Holding** — bought by Ilvaneth from Corvin Thale (session 4), **carried by Kriv**. 500 lb / 64 ft³ capacity. Contents tracked below, under "Bag of Holding — Contents" — this is the single canonical list, updated here since Kriv is the one physically carrying it.

